{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": 214,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER214.YBC",
      "sha256": "3bdce721eadfe27d7376fba1bd17cfc5a7e0d921cbb080f93d299cf81cdfcdac",
      "text_count": 49,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 204,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            0,
            1
          ],
          "text": "從現在開始，\n我們就要啟程回去安蒂米昂了，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 254,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            2,
            3,
            4
          ],
          "text": "是的。\n在我們穿越地下迷宮之前……\n可能要暫時犧牲一些悠閒的睡眠時間了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 276,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            5
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 314,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 346,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            7,
            8
          ],
          "text": "在通往白皙城砦的迷宮中，\n可能會發生激烈戰鬥的地點有三個。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 382,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            9,
            10,
            11,
            12
          ],
          "text": "我們必須解開通往安蒂米昂道路的封印，\n那就在霍雷斯迴廊。\n接著，是被深沉的黑闇所包圍的喀爾布迷宮。\n最後，是地下城砦「貝倫」。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 436,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 474,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            14,
            15,
            16
          ],
          "text": "在我們穿越了地下城砦之後，\n會有一個可以稍做休息的地方。\n那就是我們收復安蒂米昂的立足點。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 528,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            17
          ],
          "text": "……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 566,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            18,
            19,
            20
          ],
          "text": "雖然那是一個比這裡還要狹小的地方……\n但那也表示著，\n那裡會是一個比這裡還要安全的地方。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 588,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 638,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            22
          ],
          "text": "那真的是個安全的地方嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 676,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            23,
            24,
            25
          ],
          "text": "九年前，我曾經去過那裡一次。\n那裡就算是「匍伏蔓延而來之物」，\n也沒辦法……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 698,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            26
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 726,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            27,
            28
          ],
          "text": "不，就算是比「匍伏蔓延而來之物」還要厲害\n的敵人，也沒有辦法攻陷。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 780,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            29
          ],
          "text": "？？？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 802,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 852,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            31
          ],
          "text": "那麼，我們可以一直待在那裡嗎……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 874,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            32
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 902,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            33,
            34
          ],
          "text": "很遺憾，那裡沒有田地，也看不到陽光。\n沒辦法在那裡久住。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 924,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            35
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 974,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 1000,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            37
          ],
          "text": "加油吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 1054,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            38
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 1098,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            39,
            40,
            41,
            42
          ],
          "text": "能夠這樣地一起前進到今天，\n心裡面真的是有許許多多的感受。\n教導了你們不少的事情，\n相對地，也被你們教導了許多。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 1152,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            43
          ],
          "text": "……老師。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 1178,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            44
          ],
          "text": "我打從心裡感覺，你們真的是我的驕傲。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 1200,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            45
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 1250,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            46
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 214,
          "source_offset": 1282,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            47,
            48
          ],
          "text": "而且，我相信著，\n在你們的心中有著想要保護故鄉的心情。"
        }
      ],
